#. Key:	D1D89C1516364FCAA5991C41B93A0957
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.Item.Look.C2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.Item.Look.C2.Text
msgctxt ",D1D89C1516364FCAA5991C41B93A0957"
msgid "<b>\"Yin | Remove\"</>\n<b>\"What stands in the way, becomes the way.\"</>\n\nWhat does it mean?\nA way to what? Remove what?"
msgstr "<b>\"Yin | Remove\"</>\n<b>\"What stands in the way, becomes the way.\"</>\n\nWhat does it mean?\nA way to what? Remove what?"

#. Key:	50D5515AC51843B4B4A7F668A13D94DC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.Item.Look.T02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.Item.Look.T02.Text
msgctxt ",50D5515AC51843B4B4A7F668A13D94DC"
msgid "This is a song i like, \ni drew a rainbow,\nwith just a grey pencil."
msgstr "This is a song i like, \ni drew a rainbow,\nwith just a grey pencil."

#. Key:	4D61CA76A21C4A41B46F6D1C326FD244
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",4D61CA76A21C4A41B46F6D1C326FD244"
msgid "Another page...\nIt reads:"
msgstr "Another page...\nIt reads:"

#. Key:	D7214726D7CC452C98B29B2A70003DBC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",D7214726D7CC452C98B29B2A70003DBC"
msgid "\"And I stood thinking\nAnd i realized that among laughs and tears\nLife goes away\nThat giving so much to others\nI took away from myself\nThat my guide and support are my values\nAnd in that road I walk safe\nThat the look of others exists\nBut does not defines me\n..."
msgstr "\"And I stood thinking\nAnd i realized that among laughs and tears\nLife goes away\nThat giving so much to others\nI took away from myself\nThat my guide and support are my values\nAnd in that road I walk safe\nThat the look of others exists\nBut does not defines me\n..."

#. Key:	FD1F243C2B8D4A6792FAACD9CC1C4ADE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.2.Text
msgctxt ",FD1F243C2B8D4A6792FAACD9CC1C4ADE"
msgid "And I stood thinking\nThat in this present I am not the one from yesterday\nNor tomorrow\nAnd what I do with the today has influence in who I will become the next day\nBut can't change who I was the day before\n..."
msgstr "And I stood thinking\nThat in this present I am not the one from yesterday\nNor tomorrow\nAnd what I do with the today has influence in who I will become the next day\nBut can't change who I was the day before\n..."

#. Key:	C44FE1D7C74B44ACB48EC8F55B603414
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.3.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.3.Text
msgctxt ",C44FE1D7C74B44ACB48EC8F55B603414"
msgid "So I tell you...\nDon't suffer for what has happened\nYou can't change it\nDon't feel regret for what you don't know if it will happen\nThe things we plan for can change.\nEnjoy and live who you are today because that is the only thing in your hands\nThe only real thing is our present\nSo... every day come to life again\n..."
msgstr "So I tell you...\nDon't suffer for what has happened\nYou can't change it\nDon't feel regret for what you don't know if it will happen\nThe things we plan for can change.\nEnjoy and live who you are today because that is the only thing in your hands\nThe only real thing is our present\nSo... every day come to life again\n..."

#. Key:	DBE5DC57458A457592B1C10570ADA1F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.4.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.P02_T.4.Text
msgctxt ",DBE5DC57458A457592B1C10570ADA1F2"
msgid "And I stood thinking...\nThat it was simpler to stop thinking.\nThen I decided to live.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 02/07/2016"
msgstr "And I stood thinking...\nThat it was simpler to stop thinking.\nThen I decided to live.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 02/07/2016"

#. Key:	75EFB09011344F4BB157EBDAE98E5E77
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",75EFB09011344F4BB157EBDAE98E5E77"
msgid "\"SAD\"\nI'm so exhausted.\nI just want to lay down here and just stop breathing.\nI feel like my blood have been drained."
msgstr "\"SAD\"\nI'm so exhausted.\nI just want to lay down here and just stop breathing.\nI feel like my blood have been drained."

#. Key:	6B6E0741A30B425EB074A76B0B6C1E2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC00.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC00.0.Text
msgctxt ",6B6E0741A30B425EB074A76B0B6C1E2A"
msgid "Why is everything so hard?\nLike walking in mud."
msgstr "Why is everything so hard?\nLike walking in mud."

#. Key:	45CC344D1ED94081B556078FF0350168
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC00.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC00.1.Text
msgctxt ",45CC344D1ED94081B556078FF0350168"
msgid "Just push a bit more!"
msgstr "Just push a bit more!"

#. Key:	AAFA0510362141A288B9AA2F6F03522F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC01.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC01.0.Text
msgctxt ",AAFA0510362141A288B9AA2F6F03522F"
msgid "Should i take a rest?"
msgstr "Should i take a rest?"

#. Key:	1082A510A3094B40AB9433279D0EDB63
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC01.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC01.1.Text
msgctxt ",1082A510A3094B40AB9433279D0EDB63"
msgid "But we haven't fixed anything yet."
msgstr "But we haven't fixed anything yet."

#. Key:	B5E4D510B96641499C700001513813F2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC02.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC02.0.Text
msgctxt ",B5E4D510B96641499C700001513813F2"
msgid "I feel like i wanna cry."
msgstr "I feel like i wanna cry."

#. Key:	FA28437B528449D7BFDCFA99AD473EFE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC02.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.PZ02xC02.1.Text
msgctxt ",FA28437B528449D7BFDCFA99AD473EFE"
msgid "That won't fix anything."
msgstr "That won't fix anything."

#. Key:	1828800B378D46C5B382B5BDBBDD6263
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.1_rem.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.1_rem.Text
msgctxt ",1828800B378D46C5B382B5BDBBDD6263"
msgid "\"In a repeating, dim, nonsensical world.\nIt's noisy, so I shut my ears.\nWhat are we hurting each other for?\""
msgstr "\"In a repeating, dim, nonsensical world.\nIt's noisy, so I shut my ears.\nWhat are we hurting each other for?\""

#. Key:	4BF78FB8584B48008EF1D3508B9F2518
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.2_rem.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.2_rem.Text
msgctxt ",4BF78FB8584B48008EF1D3508B9F2518"
msgid "\"In the corner of a heart steeped in despair,\nAmidst accumulating shadows of contradictions,\nWhile my chest aches;\nCan I dream of tomorrow?\""
msgstr "\"In the corner of a heart steeped in despair,\nAmidst accumulating shadows of contradictions,\nWhile my chest aches;\nCan I dream of tomorrow?\""

#. Key:	BEF99B2FD1A849D8B451FC2A9B44AAD7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.3_rem.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.3_rem.Text
msgctxt ",BEF99B2FD1A849D8B451FC2A9B44AAD7"
msgid "\"In a world where soundlessly echoes resonate,\nA crying clown laughs.\nWhat should I wish for on the fallen star?\nI don't care about those silly things, It's useless.\" "
msgstr "\"In a world where soundlessly echoes resonate,\nA crying clown laughs.\nWhat should I wish for on the fallen star?\nI don't care about those silly things, It's useless.\" "

#. Key:	4245648548BA44ED9254B693D86963ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.4_rem.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02.4_rem.Text
msgctxt ",4245648548BA44ED9254B693D86963ED"
msgid "\"I held my breath inside my head,\nRepressing the fleeing me.\nWho taught me to live,\nA lifestyle with no mistakes?\""
msgstr "\"I held my breath inside my head,\nRepressing the fleeing me.\nWho taught me to live,\nA lifestyle with no mistakes?\""

#. Key:	4BC621E59C6D49A1941A6D372540903A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02_L.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02_L.Text
msgctxt ",4BC621E59C6D49A1941A6D372540903A"
msgid "I'd like to play it, but i've ran out of batteries.\nThey never last long."
msgstr "I'd like to play it, but i've ran out of batteries.\nThey never last long."

#. Key:	4A8939513BF44439980D5C42A8A3B3AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02_LI.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.T02_LI.Text
msgctxt ",4A8939513BF44439980D5C42A8A3B3AB"
msgid "Maybe with the batteries i've found."
msgstr "Maybe with the batteries i've found."

#. Key:	170B2B707E8D43B7942ACF1C2CF4211C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",170B2B707E8D43B7942ACF1C2CF4211C"
msgid "C'mon!\nThere's nothing good in there."
msgstr "C'mon!\nThere's nothing good in there."

#. Key:	E5A3CC0E0B4B4AEDA48EA59A3BB939F5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",E5A3CC0E0B4B4AEDA48EA59A3BB939F5"
msgid "Just a bit more.\nI'm getting ready."
msgstr "Just a bit more.\nI'm getting ready."

#. Key:	BCC3773952194281B3AFA98AE79CC94A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01_T.2.Text
msgctxt ",BCC3773952194281B3AFA98AE79CC94A"
msgid "We're only running around in circles.\nAt this pace we'll never get anywhere!"
msgstr "We're only running around in circles.\nAt this pace we'll never get anywhere!"

#. Key:	FAB88B206D704FCA872047E26FDC6300
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xBatts.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xBatts.Text
msgctxt ",FAB88B206D704FCA872047E26FDC6300"
msgid "Do you think it suddenly needs batteries?"
msgstr "Do you think it suddenly needs batteries?"

#. Key:	AB9ECD9919454362B7AC62510AE33E8D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC00.Text
msgctxt ",AB9ECD9919454362B7AC62510AE33E8D"
msgid "I hate this, but i wish i could get something good out of it."
msgstr "I hate this, but i wish i could get something good out of it."

#. Key:	FD7723AD6BD14E01BFDC52F7AB476F1A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC01.Text
msgctxt ",FD7723AD6BD14E01BFDC52F7AB476F1A"
msgid "Maybe, if i can't avoid getting stuck, i should try and watch something that helps me."
msgstr "Maybe, if i can't avoid getting stuck, i should try and watch something that helps me."

#. Key:	E58B5D0B65F9473D9CF71ED84231E0C7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/02/Diags02.Diags02.TV01xC02.Text
msgctxt ",E58B5D0B65F9473D9CF71ED84231E0C7"
msgid "If we want to move forward, we should stop using this."
msgstr "If we want to move forward, we should stop using this."

#. Key:	F34690CA04034DDFB5B4C746ED981F42
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.BattsPick.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.BattsPick.Text
msgctxt ",F34690CA04034DDFB5B4C746ED981F42"
msgid "They look old.\nMaybe if i warm them in my hand they'll last for a song."
msgstr "They look old.\nMaybe if i warm them in my hand they'll last for a song."

#. Key:	A638CA7C695540E0AEF2F4E1A69C60F0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.BK00_T.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.BK00_T.Text
msgctxt ",A638CA7C695540E0AEF2F4E1A69C60F0"
