msgctxt ",D644ADC5EBFD4B8C9FA7973F9B5A7634"
msgid "Why do you care so much?\nYou also make a lot of noise all the time."
msgstr "Why do you care so much?\nYou also make a lot of noise all the time."

#. Key:	8EA6356C717F425C8B648AF687581399
