#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",C353EDBA858549CE9D831261D3C5B178"
msgid "Well, i'm arguing with mom in this one.\nI was so upset."
msgstr "Well, i'm arguing with mom in this one.\nI was so upset."

#. Key:	6A5DDF3817A748998CC4AE447DA23B64
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06_T.2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06_T.2.Text
msgctxt ",6A5DDF3817A748998CC4AE447DA23B64"
msgid "And this one was right after mom got angry at me.\n...\nI always felt this picture was mocking me."
msgstr "And this one was right after mom got angry at me.\n...\nI always felt this picture was mocking me."

#. Key:	36C26205EB44438D9D78A6C55F113FB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06_T.3.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06_T.3.Text
msgctxt ",36C26205EB44438D9D78A6C55F113FB9"
msgid "I guess she's right.\nWe shouldn't make her angry all the time."
msgstr "I guess she's right.\nWe shouldn't make her angry all the time."

#. Key:	236CF8F80A564DAB878C944D5C8C9698
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC00.Text
msgctxt ",236CF8F80A564DAB878C944D5C8C9698"
msgid "We should put this in order, so it looks cleaner."
msgstr "We should put this in order, so it looks cleaner."

#. Key:	D931705E3A734263BBB0956274E17ACC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC01.Text
msgctxt ",D931705E3A734263BBB0956274E17ACC"
msgid "Just turn them around and stop wasting time."
msgstr "Just turn them around and stop wasting time."

#. Key:	BA3D17422D634C77841246067729FCFC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.PZ06xC02.Text
msgctxt ",BA3D17422D634C77841246067729FCFC"
msgid "I'm tired of cleaning things up.\nThere's always more.\nI guess it will never end and i'll have to do it."
msgstr "I'm tired of cleaning things up.\nThere's always more.\nI guess it will never end and i'll have to do it."

#. Key:	C47B42FAE4434887A830A8D2A202AE0A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.T03_L.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.T03_L.Text
msgctxt ",C47B42FAE4434887A830A8D2A202AE0A"
msgid "No batteries,\nthough."
msgstr "No batteries,\nthough."

#. Key:	4B6AFBD2F42242188C7B9134617159AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.T03_LI.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/03/Diags03.Diags03.T03_LI.Text
msgctxt ",4B6AFBD2F42242188C7B9134617159AC"
msgid "Try the batteries..."
msgstr "Try the batteries..."

#. Key:	65178356512D4E28B9B61E680262ADAA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",65178356512D4E28B9B61E680262ADAA"
msgid "The last page says that when arguing with others it is best to ask questions.\nTalk about what you <b>feel</>, and not how things \"are\".\nAnd <b>accept</> their views as <i>valid experiences</>."
msgstr "The last page says that when arguing with others it is best to ask questions.\nTalk about what you <b>feel</>, and not how things \"are\".\nAnd <b>accept</> their views as <i>valid experiences</>."

#. Key:	91C8800C81DF4FE99F5559068F32FE27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",91C8800C81DF4FE99F5559068F32FE27"
msgid "There's a cheat-sheet:\n\"\n* Which emotion is it?\n* How does it feel in the body?\n* What's the oldest memory with the same feeling?\n* What did you need at that time?\n* What did you want to say at that time?\n* How are things different now?\""
msgstr "There's a cheat-sheet:\n\"\n* Which emotion is it?\n* How does it feel in the body?\n* What's the oldest memory with the same feeling?\n* What did you need at that time?\n* What did you want to say at that time?\n* How are things different now?\""

#. Key:	E17F44A853F64408B21C9FA922A831FB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.BK01_T.2.Text
msgctxt ",E17F44A853F64408B21C9FA922A831FB"
msgid "Who would do that?"
msgstr "Who would do that?"

#. Key:	773F11FA069241C9ADC7ABDE4ED68E8B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.00.Text
msgctxt ",773F11FA069241C9ADC7ABDE4ED68E8B"
msgid "C'mon, don't just sit!\nI wanna leave!"
msgstr "C'mon, don't just sit!\nI wanna leave!"

#. Key:	35682973084C4BE88DFB9C25FEF57D0B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.01.Text
msgctxt ",35682973084C4BE88DFB9C25FEF57D0B"
msgid "We could make a plan first.\nMaybe we should eat something first."
msgstr "We could make a plan first.\nMaybe we should eat something first."

#. Key:	5FD803D76C914B379FAAA1727542E9FE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.02.Text
msgctxt ",5FD803D76C914B379FAAA1727542E9FE"
msgid "You will just drag it out.\nLet's leave!"
msgstr "You will just drag it out.\nLet's leave!"

#. Key:	69DAEDCCAF63467FB7734C116D86952C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.03.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.03.Text
msgctxt ",69DAEDCCAF63467FB7734C116D86952C"
msgid "You're <b>too selfish</>."
msgstr "You're <b>too selfish</>."

#. Key:	73C9D5993A4A47ED8C7D71C3E88D02D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.04.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.04.Text
msgctxt ",73C9D5993A4A47ED8C7D71C3E88D02D5"
msgid "No! I'm not!\nYou're too mean."
msgstr "No! I'm not!\nYou're too mean."

#. Key:	21DB271E18CF406895C3DC9580D61DDD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.05.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.05.Text
msgctxt ",21DB271E18CF406895C3DC9580D61DDD"
msgid "And <b>you're</> too...!"
msgstr "And <b>you're</> too...!"

#. Key:	EE921E9620394351A0C274177058FDC9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.06.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.06.Text
msgctxt ",EE921E9620394351A0C274177058FDC9"
msgid "Why don't we try what the book said?\nHow do you feel?"
msgstr "Why don't we try what the book said?\nHow do you feel?"

#. Key:	2A71526E892A439EB5410EA8E4FCFA8D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.08.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.08.Text
msgctxt ",2A71526E892A439EB5410EA8E4FCFA8D"
msgid "What the fuck?\nWhat does it matter?!"
msgstr "What the fuck?\nWhat does it matter?!"

#. Key:	D357F02FE5E84AA3A45D132D2401A452
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.09.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.09.Text
msgctxt ",D357F02FE5E84AA3A45D132D2401A452"
msgid "<b>Try</> it."
msgstr "<b>Try</> it."

#. Key:	0F0C18F0F84D4D9AB12877B1CC0E2DA0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.10.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.10.Text
msgctxt ",0F0C18F0F84D4D9AB12877B1CC0E2DA0"
msgid "I feel like im going to explode if we don't leave now!\nI feel hot in the body, and my fists are tight.\nSame as my jaws."
msgstr "I feel like im going to explode if we don't leave now!\nI feel hot in the body, and my fists are tight.\nSame as my jaws."

#. Key:	15B56F843C8E4AAC88AB93F0AC13DE44
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.11.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.11.Text
msgctxt ",15B56F843C8E4AAC88AB93F0AC13DE44"
msgid "What's the <i>emotion</>?"
msgstr "What's the <i>emotion</>?"

#. Key:	787B17679D8544AB86D700AB6ADDA2A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.12.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.12.Text
msgctxt ",787B17679D8544AB86D700AB6ADDA2A4"
msgid "I... don't know, I just... just ...\nI'm just sick of all this!"
msgstr "I... don't know, I just... just ...\nI'm just sick of all this!"

#. Key:	8A5FC52959E44FCEAAE66B60045DE5A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.13.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.13.Text
msgctxt ",8A5FC52959E44FCEAAE66B60045DE5A3"
msgid "Sounds like <i>anger</>."
msgstr "Sounds like <i>anger</>."

#. Key:	8C85D9AE06DF40089C88B91C0E10DEA4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.14.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.14.Text
msgctxt ",8C85D9AE06DF40089C88B91C0E10DEA4"
msgid "Angry about what?"
msgstr "Angry about what?"

#. Key:	AEDF1B3F5B694DC88946D9EE48233F9B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.15.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.15.Text
msgctxt ",AEDF1B3F5B694DC88946D9EE48233F9B"
msgid "I'm sick of everyone always stepping on me,\nI'm sick of everything always going wrong! "
msgstr "I'm sick of everyone always stepping on me,\nI'm sick of everything always going wrong! "

#. Key:	4637B384AA164D159471BABA1F97FB21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.16.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.16.Text
msgctxt ",4637B384AA164D159471BABA1F97FB21"
msgid "You are quite strong.\nWhy do you want to fight?"
msgstr "You are quite strong.\nWhy do you want to fight?"

#. Key:	063FB0D7A835413BB7CC8C1C88612854
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.17.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.17.Text
msgctxt ",063FB0D7A835413BB7CC8C1C88612854"
msgid "I want a change!\nI feel so <b>stuck!!</>\nEven though I try hard, nothing ever changes!"
msgstr "I want a change!\nI feel so <b>stuck!!</>\nEven though I try hard, nothing ever changes!"

#. Key:	1633AF7EBFCC4BD1BFA06A1BDCD0A8B0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.18.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.18.Text
msgctxt ",1633AF7EBFCC4BD1BFA06A1BDCD0A8B0"
msgid "You don't <i>look</> <b>powerless</>.\nI wonder,  what's <b>really</> going on?"
msgstr "You don't <i>look</> <b>powerless</>.\nI wonder,  what's <b>really</> going on?"

#. Key:	67A174F6C7C440CDA6490B85BD93EAAF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.19.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.19.Text
msgctxt ",67A174F6C7C440CDA6490B85BD93EAAF"
msgid "[Cries]\nI don't want him to leave!\nIt's all very dangerous."
msgstr "[Cries]\nI don't want him to leave!\nIt's all very dangerous."

#. Key:	25CAF5ED655849CF8CB0074DAFEBED9B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.20.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.20.Text
msgctxt ",25CAF5ED655849CF8CB0074DAFEBED9B"
msgid "She looks powerless, not him."
msgstr "She looks powerless, not him."

#. Key:	088E706FF30A4F24ACCA59C18B913727
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.21.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.21.Text
msgctxt ",088E706FF30A4F24ACCA59C18B913727"
msgid "Oh...\nIt's <b>her</> that you're <i>actually</> protecting?"
msgstr "Oh...\nIt's <b>her</> that you're <i>actually</> protecting?"

#. Key:	35BE404123B541ADADE799B32778B5B7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.22.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.22.Text
msgctxt ",35BE404123B541ADADE799B32778B5B7"
msgid "[Keeps crying]\nWhen he's here...\nAt least he can say the things I can't."
msgstr "[Keeps crying]\nWhen he's here...\nAt least he can say the things I can't."

#. Key:	6419A15EBCBD4A949EC4EB8AAD61C9EB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.23.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.23.Text
msgctxt ",6419A15EBCBD4A949EC4EB8AAD61C9EB"
msgid "I'm tired of people making her cry."
msgstr "I'm tired of people making her cry."

#. Key:	A9A5ACD7B5FA4E429509EAECFCBE0380
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.24.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S1.24.Text
msgctxt ",A9A5ACD7B5FA4E429509EAECFCBE0380"
msgid "It's ok...\nWe're together now, <i>right</>?\nTogether can come up with <b>new</> solutions, <i>right</>?"
msgstr "It's ok...\nWe're together now, <i>right</>?\nTogether can come up with <b>new</> solutions, <i>right</>?"

#. Key:	FCC6C72F066E4AECA7BF98773DF28079
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.00.Text
msgctxt ",FCC6C72F066E4AECA7BF98773DF28079"
msgid "Why didn't you <b>said</> anything <i>before?</>"
msgstr "Why didn't you <b>said</> anything <i>before?</>"

#. Key:	F629AD5FCD604FC3A4BAA3588823C36E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.01.Text
msgctxt ",F629AD5FCD604FC3A4BAA3588823C36E"
msgid "I tried, but it only makes things worse.\n...\nPeople get angry at me."
msgstr "I tried, but it only makes things worse.\n...\nPeople get angry at me."

#. Key:	0BB141504E0E4C9384CCFB60BDA728B5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.02.Text
msgctxt ",0BB141504E0E4C9384CCFB60BDA728B5"
msgid "Hmmm...\nHow does that makes you feel?"
msgstr "Hmmm...\nHow does that makes you feel?"

#. Key:	DDC971D2A15D4245AD68536793649F63
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.03.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.03.Text
msgctxt ",DDC971D2A15D4245AD68536793649F63"
msgid "Everything seems so dangerous.\nI feel as if my blood just left my body.\nI feel like nothing matters anymore."
msgstr "Everything seems so dangerous.\nI feel as if my blood just left my body.\nI feel like nothing matters anymore."

#. Key:	218102BE34A740139E2B5FA0528932BF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.04.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.04.Text
msgctxt ",218102BE34A740139E2B5FA0528932BF"
msgid "I want to throw myself to the floor.\nJust die and let the earth consume me.\nLike I'm just waiting for death."
msgstr "I want to throw myself to the floor.\nJust die and let the earth consume me.\nLike I'm just waiting for death."

#. Key:	B69B737326E84A40B61A915B5AD15E88
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.05.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.05.Text
msgctxt ",B69B737326E84A40B61A915B5AD15E88"
msgid "That <b>must</> be <i>scary</>..."
msgstr "That <b>must</> be <i>scary</>..."

#. Key:	B344EC2A30574B30A6B0ED102C243FAA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.06.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.06.Text
msgctxt ",B344EC2A30574B30A6B0ED102C243FAA"
msgid "I can see why.\nYou're so small."
msgstr "I can see why.\nYou're so small."

#. Key:	93EA219EA3824CBF9D5182B000ADBCEC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.07.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.07.Text
msgctxt ",93EA219EA3824CBF9D5182B000ADBCEC"
msgid "[Cries]"
msgstr "[Cries]"

#. Key:	DDECB80F7F134E1094F147DCF23CC8A1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.08.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.08.Text
msgctxt ",DDECB80F7F134E1094F147DCF23CC8A1"
msgid "Why do you <I>cry</>?"
msgstr "Why do you <I>cry</>?"

#. Key:	222994BC995A4C16ADA6885C3F427251
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.09.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.09.Text
msgctxt ",222994BC995A4C16ADA6885C3F427251"
msgid "I don't know.\nNo one ever said something like that to me.\nI always felt like I had to do things perfectly.\nLike everyone else."
msgstr "I don't know.\nNo one ever said something like that to me.\nI always felt like I had to do things perfectly.\nLike everyone else."

#. Key:	0B787113682F4B0AAA2A31C2D71351C0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.10.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.10.Text
msgctxt ",0B787113682F4B0AAA2A31C2D71351C0"
msgid "Well, everyone else is older.\nA kid doing adult's stuff sounds hard, and unfair.\nEveryone makes mistakes too."
msgstr "Well, everyone else is older.\nA kid doing adult's stuff sounds hard, and unfair.\nEveryone makes mistakes too."

#. Key:	C93272FF78024125901A81FCBC1FB080
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.11.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.11.Text
msgctxt ",C93272FF78024125901A81FCBC1FB080"
msgid "I always felt like everything was too much.\nI feel so trapped and stuck.\nI feel like nothing will ever improve."
msgstr "I always felt like everything was too much.\nI feel so trapped and stuck.\nI feel like nothing will ever improve."

#. Key:	A5F54882EB2D409B9F04B6324F140860
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.12.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.12.Text
msgctxt ",A5F54882EB2D409B9F04B6324F140860"
msgid "I can't push back.\nI can only do what others want me to do."
msgstr "I can't push back.\nI can only do what others want me to do."

#. Key:	1DAC7F8873CA42448FA07169710877FF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.13.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.13.Text
msgctxt ",1DAC7F8873CA42448FA07169710877FF"
msgid "You had no other choice than to hide.\nI'm sorry..."
msgstr "You had no other choice than to hide.\nI'm sorry..."

#. Key:	DB66BB34D5A84178AFCBA59F7F238060
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.14.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.14.Text
msgctxt ",DB66BB34D5A84178AFCBA59F7F238060"
msgid "[Cries]"
msgstr "[Cries]"

#. Key:	B633AE86D39641A7AB527AA5559E39A8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.15.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.15.Text
msgctxt ",B633AE86D39641A7AB527AA5559E39A8"
msgid "That was actually <b>very smart</>, <i>y'know?</>\nA way to stay safe."
msgstr "That was actually <b>very smart</>, <i>y'know?</>\nA way to stay safe."

#. Key:	26574632F5834523AB2245871AAC18F7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.16.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.16.Text
msgctxt ",26574632F5834523AB2245871AAC18F7"
msgid "[Cries]\nI am just trying to survive."
msgstr "[Cries]\nI am just trying to survive."

#. Key:	227A8C47094F4A3CB0A2EC43FCD3F431
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.17.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.17.Text
msgctxt ",227A8C47094F4A3CB0A2EC43FCD3F431"
msgid "Maybe one day they will leave me alone."
msgstr "Maybe one day they will leave me alone."

#. Key:	930EF6B9B11B430994D46A2E634CF7BE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.18.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.18.Text
msgctxt ",930EF6B9B11B430994D46A2E634CF7BE"
msgid "You are with us now."
msgstr "You are with us now."

#. Key:	0A76096B34494122998374F7D8242B0E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.19.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.19.Text
msgctxt ",0A76096B34494122998374F7D8242B0E"
msgid "And you <b>are</> <i>growing</>.\nThings might not change, but <b>you're not the same</>."
msgstr "And you <b>are</> <i>growing</>.\nThings might not change, but <b>you're not the same</>."

#. Key:	4D9F45446CC04A90912AF0175C141501
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.20.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.20.Text
msgctxt ",4D9F45446CC04A90912AF0175C141501"
msgid "Do you think?"
msgstr "Do you think?"

#. Key:	03B16DBD34864615BECEED9F2C1787A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.21.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.21.Text
msgctxt ",03B16DBD34864615BECEED9F2C1787A4"
msgid "Yes.\nIn a way, you were protecting us as well..."
msgstr "Yes.\nIn a way, you were protecting us as well..."

#. Key:	45D13E2FF5F848A98319C91F802AA107
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.22.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S3.22.Text
msgctxt ",45D13E2FF5F848A98319C91F802AA107"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Thanks."

#. Key:	3DF34EA6D91045AD851A961958F609CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.00.Text
msgctxt ",3DF34EA6D91045AD851A961958F609CE"
msgid "I <i>think</> I'm starting to see how <b>she</> was <b>suffering</>."
msgstr "I <i>think</> I'm starting to see how <b>she</> was <b>suffering</>."

#. Key:	694A8950AA184231929EB1611A3D2106
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.01.Text
msgctxt ",694A8950AA184231929EB1611A3D2106"
msgid "What's the feeling?"
msgstr "What's the feeling?"

#. Key:	434C0F96B9624D4E85677EBA690E6252
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.02.Text
msgctxt ",434C0F96B9624D4E85677EBA690E6252"
msgid "It's <i>weird</>.\nKinda <b>sad</>."
msgstr "It's <i>weird</>.\nKinda <b>sad</>."

#. Key:	C1913A69C4374288AC905B2F9747FCEE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.03.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.03.Text
msgctxt ",C1913A69C4374288AC905B2F9747FCEE"
msgid "Why did you took their side, then?"
msgstr "Why did you took their side, then?"

#. Key:	B87A583E3E2F4DFD92ACB1F5585790EE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.04.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.04.Text
msgctxt ",B87A583E3E2F4DFD92ACB1F5585790EE"
msgid "I was just <i>trying</> to <b>help</>."
msgstr "I was just <i>trying</> to <b>help</>."

#. Key:	5B25AA578957406CBFBBD159DCA6F620
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.05.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.05.Text
msgctxt ",5B25AA578957406CBFBBD159DCA6F620"
msgid "I feel <b>bad</>.\n<i>Maybe</> I've made things <b>worse</> for her."
msgstr "I feel <b>bad</>.\n<i>Maybe</> I've made things <b>worse</> for her."

#. Key:	27CBF90960C849B5A28298F6F943CC18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.06.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.06.Text
msgctxt ",27CBF90960C849B5A28298F6F943CC18"
msgid "Instead of <i>helping</>,\nI was <b>opposing</> her."
msgstr "Instead of <i>helping</>,\nI was <b>opposing</> her."

#. Key:	2DC2B44D14064D6DA729661CF2D0A17D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.07.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.07.Text
msgctxt ",2DC2B44D14064D6DA729661CF2D0A17D"
msgid "[Cries]"
msgstr "[Cries]"

#. Key:	521D4553E53C413BBCC13CD77257F1F4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.08.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.08.Text
msgctxt ",521D4553E53C413BBCC13CD77257F1F4"
msgid "Don't <i>look</> at <b>me</>.\n[Cries]"
msgstr "Don't <i>look</> at <b>me</>.\n[Cries]"

#. Key:	A2201D1C61D84EA484AD1AD9C3522555
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.09.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.09.Text
msgctxt ",A2201D1C61D84EA484AD1AD9C3522555"
msgid "It's ok.\nWe always knew.\nI'm not going to think bad of you.\nYou don't need to feel <i>ashamed</>."
msgstr "It's ok.\nWe always knew.\nI'm not going to think bad of you.\nYou don't need to feel <i>ashamed</>."

#. Key:	7B5101FB63EF465392112BBA50358C6B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.10.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.10.Text
msgctxt ",7B5101FB63EF465392112BBA50358C6B"
msgid "I just wanted all of us to <i>get along</> and <b>stop fighting</>, <b>y'know?</>\n[Cries]"
msgstr "I just wanted all of us to <i>get along</> and <b>stop fighting</>, <b>y'know?</>\n[Cries]"

#. Key:	B5688F8B92704660BC7CFC14B6A894AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.11.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.11.Text
msgctxt ",B5688F8B92704660BC7CFC14B6A894AA"
msgid "You have your way of doing things.\nI know the pain.\nWas it hurting you too?"
msgstr "You have your way of doing things.\nI know the pain.\nWas it hurting you too?"

#. Key:	9FCF67F7FC0642C1BBB13A5A5C97189D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.12.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.12.Text
msgctxt ",9FCF67F7FC0642C1BBB13A5A5C97189D"
msgid "I was trying to be a <b>good child</>.\n<i>They</> wanted that.\nThey <i>said</> that's what they <b>needed</>."
msgstr "I was trying to be a <b>good child</>.\n<i>They</> wanted that.\nThey <i>said</> that's what they <b>needed</>."

#. Key:	76A397FD0B4F4A4395FC5549C709A9C9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.13.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.13.Text
msgctxt ",76A397FD0B4F4A4395FC5549C709A9C9"
msgid "Sounds very painful, exhausting, and confusing."
msgstr "Sounds very painful, exhausting, and confusing."

#. Key:	9B9621468E7C47B7BD4D4B46CA56CCAE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.14.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.14.Text
msgctxt ",9B9621468E7C47B7BD4D4B46CA56CCAE"
msgid "I've tried <b>so hard</> to make things <b>perfectly</>.\nBut <i>whatever</> I did, it was <i>always</> bad, <b>always a problem</>."
msgstr "I've tried <b>so hard</> to make things <b>perfectly</>.\nBut <i>whatever</> I did, it was <i>always</> bad, <b>always a problem</>."

#. Key:	53BB738D72714928A03A73074F42297D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.15.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.15.Text
msgctxt ",53BB738D72714928A03A73074F42297D"
msgid "I can see you tried really hard."
msgstr "I can see you tried really hard."

#. Key:	DAB2EF4741FF430583B295091E85FF6D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.16.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.16.Text
msgctxt ",DAB2EF4741FF430583B295091E85FF6D"
msgid "<b>Gosh!</>\nThis is <i>new</>.\nI'm starting to feel <b>angry and sad!</>"
msgstr "<b>Gosh!</>\nThis is <i>new</>.\nI'm starting to feel <b>angry and sad!</>"

#. Key:	63197CEF8D9D461B9D8609985AB15864
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.17.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.17.Text
msgctxt ",63197CEF8D9D461B9D8609985AB15864"
msgid "Well, you wouldn't have been \"perfect\" if you felt angry right?"
msgstr "Well, you wouldn't have been \"perfect\" if you felt angry right?"

#. Key:	429943B6370C4F39897120124694266D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.18.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.18.Text
msgctxt ",429943B6370C4F39897120124694266D"
msgid "No.\nThey've said they <b>needed</> us to behave."
msgstr "No.\nThey've said they <b>needed</> us to behave."

#. Key:	50F761063B4E43A58EE829CE911609C4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.19.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.19.Text
msgctxt ",50F761063B4E43A58EE829CE911609C4"
msgid "In truth you (we) weren't allowed to feel anything.\nWhat does the new anger tells you?"
msgstr "In truth you (we) weren't allowed to feel anything.\nWhat does the new anger tells you?"

#. Key:	6FFABBA334D34BF2B91358E77FEB8A98
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.20.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.20.Text
msgctxt ",6FFABBA334D34BF2B91358E77FEB8A98"
msgid "After <b>all</> the effort!\nIt was <b>never</> enough!\nI feel <b>so</> <i>cheated!</>\n[sobs]"
msgstr "After <b>all</> the effort!\nIt was <b>never</> enough!\nI feel <b>so</> <i>cheated!</>\n[sobs]"

#. Key:	5DD40DE58EC848D89D78F894ECF1D0DD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.21.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.21.Text
msgctxt ",5DD40DE58EC848D89D78F894ECF1D0DD"
msgid "Well... i think you <b>have</> been cheated.\nThey've promised something and then didn't deliver.\nAnd they've made you feel it was your fault.\nThat's a scam."
msgstr "Well... i think you <b>have</> been cheated.\nThey've promised something and then didn't deliver.\nAnd they've made you feel it was your fault.\nThat's a scam."

#. Key:	FFC758430CDF4405B1776506A7DCEE58
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.22.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.22.1.Text
msgctxt ",FFC758430CDF4405B1776506A7DCEE58"
msgid "[Cries]"
msgstr "[Cries]"

#. Key:	8606A625E2444AB29DEBD503F7B06827
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.22.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.22.Text
msgctxt ",8606A625E2444AB29DEBD503F7B06827"
msgid "All I ever wanted was to just feel <b>safe and accepted</>,\nto be ok,\nto be at <i>peace</>."
msgstr "All I ever wanted was to just feel <b>safe and accepted</>,\nto be ok,\nto be at <i>peace</>."

#. Key:	894AAF991A644178AC2F3E7DE72F4475
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.23.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.23.Text
msgctxt ",894AAF991A644178AC2F3E7DE72F4475"
msgid "It's ok.\nYou're doing your best.\nAnd you are trying to do what's good.\nYou can be with us, we're not gonna attack you for that."
msgstr "It's ok.\nYou're doing your best.\nAnd you are trying to do what's good.\nYou can be with us, we're not gonna attack you for that."

#. Key:	5AF423F7A1B84BE6B7135877012000A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.24.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S5.24.Text
msgctxt ",5AF423F7A1B84BE6B7135877012000A4"
msgid "<b>Thanks.</>"
msgstr "<b>Thanks.</>"

#. Key:	B66B1E9352074FED94A9F55844AE45E4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.00.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.00.Text
msgctxt ",B66B1E9352074FED94A9F55844AE45E4"
msgid "I'm alone again...\nEverything seems so overwhelming...\nWill i be able to do this?"
msgstr "I'm alone again...\nEverything seems so overwhelming...\nWill i be able to do this?"

#. Key:	FE08D13CA1A24382BDE9B20EBEB67830
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.01.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.01.Text
msgctxt ",FE08D13CA1A24382BDE9B20EBEB67830"
msgid "Let's see...\nWhat would be the feeling?"
msgstr "Let's see...\nWhat would be the feeling?"

#. Key:	9AD915B77488496FB682A2E6FC534200
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.02.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.02.Text
msgctxt ",9AD915B77488496FB682A2E6FC534200"
msgid "Fear, i guess.\nAnd anxiety?\nAs if my body is about to start running."
msgstr "Fear, i guess.\nAnd anxiety?\nAs if my body is about to start running."

#. Key:	8FA43396D2A849CC9B8C803ACE23E58F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.03.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.03.Text
msgctxt ",8FA43396D2A849CC9B8C803ACE23E58F"
msgid "What does it feels like?"
msgstr "What does it feels like?"

#. Key:	F602246F5DDF4FC89552C845304E3E19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.04.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.04.Text
msgctxt ",F602246F5DDF4FC89552C845304E3E19"
msgid "I don't feel proud about it.\nI feel ashamed of running all the time.\nI feel small, scared, and stuck."
msgstr "I don't feel proud about it.\nI feel ashamed of running all the time.\nI feel small, scared, and stuck."

#. Key:	912EDC688EFE43219DCEEF5D451FC809
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.05.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.05.Text
msgctxt ",912EDC688EFE43219DCEEF5D451FC809"
msgid "When did it started?"
msgstr "When did it started?"

#. Key:	E511DC791C0C4817ACAA2390BE061E73
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.06.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.06.Text
msgctxt ",E511DC791C0C4817ACAA2390BE061E73"
msgid "Ever since i can remember...\nEverything was always very dangerous.\nAnd i was always alone.\nRunning away was the only thing i could do."
msgstr "Ever since i can remember...\nEverything was always very dangerous.\nAnd i was always alone.\nRunning away was the only thing i could do."

#. Key:	D9E3FB1C42164745B080AF234786519B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.07.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.07.Text
msgctxt ",D9E3FB1C42164745B080AF234786519B"
msgid "I guess that for an abandoned kid the only option is to run away."
msgstr "I guess that for an abandoned kid the only option is to run away."

#. Key:	CBBD0E32EB1F4819AE06A1BE4555806C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.08.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.08.Text
msgctxt ",CBBD0E32EB1F4819AE06A1BE4555806C"
msgid "Actually a kid needs help from adults...\nBut the ones that should help...\nscared me...\nand hurted me..."
msgstr "Actually a kid needs help from adults...\nBut the ones that should help...\nscared me...\nand hurted me..."

#. Key:	D43847A32884451F8F5FF7F413E4EECB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.09.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.09.Text
msgctxt ",D43847A32884451F8F5FF7F413E4EECB"
msgid "That's so wrong, mean, and unfair!!\nNo wonder i ran away!\nNo wonder it was always so confusing.\nDamn! I always thought it was all my fault!"
msgstr "That's so wrong, mean, and unfair!!\nNo wonder i ran away!\nNo wonder it was always so confusing.\nDamn! I always thought it was all my fault!"

#. Key:	12B6BECD4E2E48CD8C1DCAA9E576B865
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.10.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.10.Text
msgctxt ",12B6BECD4E2E48CD8C1DCAA9E576B865"
msgid "Wait!\nHow can i blame a little child for being afraid?\nWell, i guess it wasn't my fault."
msgstr "Wait!\nHow can i blame a little child for being afraid?\nWell, i guess it wasn't my fault."

#. Key:	ED76C20F480940BB8DE78149ED162009
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.11.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.11.Text
msgctxt ",ED76C20F480940BB8DE78149ED162009"
msgid "Maybe i shouldn't feel bad for running.\nWhat else could i have done?\nIt kept me alive!\nI think i should be thankful and proud of it then."
msgstr "Maybe i shouldn't feel bad for running.\nWhat else could i have done?\nIt kept me alive!\nI think i should be thankful and proud of it then."

#. Key:	925B32B020754C87BD15E84E74F2F628
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.12.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.12.Text
msgctxt ",925B32B020754C87BD15E84E74F2F628"
msgid "But then, i started feeling stuck.\nWaiting..."
msgstr "But then, i started feeling stuck.\nWaiting..."

#. Key:	2ECC5B4E597D4B3DBBE016458756CCF1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.13.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.13.Text
msgctxt ",2ECC5B4E597D4B3DBBE016458756CCF1"
msgid "Waiting for what?"
msgstr "Waiting for what?"

#. Key:	754E25C0F4CA409E870B01752778766D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.14.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.14.Text
msgctxt ",754E25C0F4CA409E870B01752778766D"
msgid "For another day.\nFor a change.\nFor a chance."
msgstr "For another day.\nFor a change.\nFor a chance."

#. Key:	98D81067B36D4157AA73CC10D43989AF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.15.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.15.Text
msgctxt ",98D81067B36D4157AA73CC10D43989AF"
msgid "But I could never change anything around me.\nI was very small and powerless, and no one took me seriously.\nThings never changed."
msgstr "But I could never change anything around me.\nI was very small and powerless, and no one took me seriously.\nThings never changed."

#. Key:	9BDA02ADF2664041958DCD25B2148582
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.16.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.16.Text
msgctxt ",9BDA02ADF2664041958DCD25B2148582"
msgid "What if...\nmaybe...\ni could change myself?"
msgstr "What if...\nmaybe...\ni could change myself?"

#. Key:	24D7637EBE3547368613D5973E0244A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.17.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.17.Text
msgctxt ",24D7637EBE3547368613D5973E0244A5"
msgid "Am i different?\nHow?"
msgstr "Am i different?\nHow?"

#. Key:	CA88E10AEE4C4D48B625F0685555A8FC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.18.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.18.Text
msgctxt ",CA88E10AEE4C4D48B625F0685555A8FC"
msgid "Well, i'm not a kid anymore."
msgstr "Well, i'm not a kid anymore."

#. Key:	9B80D26EAF644212BCF42B71B6447509
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.19.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.19.Text
msgctxt ",9B80D26EAF644212BCF42B71B6447509"
msgid "Maybe I've changed.\nMaybe I can do something different now.\nMaybe I have other options."
msgstr "Maybe I've changed.\nMaybe I can do something different now.\nMaybe I have other options."

#. Key:	A460990EF5CA48EB883455FEDB9E3B50
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.20.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.20.Text
msgctxt ",A460990EF5CA48EB883455FEDB9E3B50"
msgid "As long as I keep trying,\nAnd keep my goal of \"being fine\" in my mind...\nI'll keep adding tricks and tools...\nEventually, I could break the cycle."
msgstr "As long as I keep trying,\nAnd keep my goal of \"being fine\" in my mind...\nI'll keep adding tricks and tools...\nEventually, I could break the cycle."

#. Key:	247AC75E467C44B899880F55C52BF43C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.21.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.21.Text
msgctxt ",247AC75E467C44B899880F55C52BF43C"
msgid "Even if things around me don't change.\nI could change."
msgstr "Even if things around me don't change.\nI could change."

#. Key:	C614C4563B5748168B3C5A639197CD27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.22.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.22.Text
msgctxt ",C614C4563B5748168B3C5A639197CD27"
msgid "I still have today."
msgstr "I still have today."

#. Key:	85C23CD8718A4BD7B1D015E3F5E0C22D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.23.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S7.23.Text
msgctxt ",85C23CD8718A4BD7B1D015E3F5E0C22D"
msgid "It's not over yet."
msgstr "It's not over yet."

#. Key:	1A001FB7962B49399D0EA486CCF2047A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.0.Text
msgctxt ",1A001FB7962B49399D0EA486CCF2047A"
msgid "In truth i've always been alone.\nEven when there were others around."
msgstr "In truth i've always been alone.\nEven when there were others around."

#. Key:	F16FDD005FC1453FA61D869888EFF64E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.1.Text
msgctxt ",F16FDD005FC1453FA61D869888EFF64E"
msgid "Being alone, surrounded by people, is so painful."
msgstr "Being alone, surrounded by people, is so painful."

#. Key:	FB653D55174F4D1F8AF045A1639E0DB6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.2.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.2.Text
msgctxt ",FB653D55174F4D1F8AF045A1639E0DB6"
msgid "Maybe now that i'm starting to be one with myself.\nSomehow the gap will be reduced.\nAnd the solitude will start to go away."
msgstr "Maybe now that i'm starting to be one with myself.\nSomehow the gap will be reduced.\nAnd the solitude will start to go away."

#. Key:	6B8D45C368C44FB196CF9F62E19F7143
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.3.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.3.Text
msgctxt ",6B8D45C368C44FB196CF9F62E19F7143"
msgid "That possibility is <b>not</> a blind hope.\nIt does not change much.\nI've learnt to not trust promises."
msgstr "That possibility is <b>not</> a blind hope.\nIt does not change much.\nI've learnt to not trust promises."

#. Key:	6724F1ACEFE44EBFAF5B2B9D8784C285
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.4.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.4.Text
msgctxt ",6724F1ACEFE44EBFAF5B2B9D8784C285"
msgid "I have no certainty that things will ever be fine.\nI've learnt to just keep moving forward."
msgstr "I have no certainty that things will ever be fine.\nI've learnt to just keep moving forward."

#. Key:	DB702DEF3A9342F597223FFC97945D21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.5.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.5.Text
msgctxt ",DB702DEF3A9342F597223FFC97945D21"
msgid "Now, I won't abandom or neglect myself, like I've been thaught.\nNow, I'm getting back the most important thing that got stolen from me: <b>Myself</>."
msgstr "Now, I won't abandom or neglect myself, like I've been thaught.\nNow, I'm getting back the most important thing that got stolen from me: <b>Myself</>."

#. Key:	0F0A85D8AF5541208BAD70A478A6DB04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.6.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.C4S9.6.Text
msgctxt ",0F0A85D8AF5541208BAD70A478A6DB04"
msgid "I've got myself now."
msgstr "I've got myself now."

#. Key:	E4DA6F86A70445C58A07372A67ECCAFC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.D17_L.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.D17_L.Text
msgctxt ",E4DA6F86A70445C58A07372A67ECCAFC"
msgid "Maybe we shouldn't go back just yet..."
msgstr "Maybe we shouldn't go back just yet..."

#. Key:	D350A29F89464D16BC6385D371B8C214
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Food00_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Food00_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",D350A29F89464D16BC6385D371B8C214"
msgid "Rice.\nBoring.\nI'm tired of eating plain rice."
msgstr "Rice.\nBoring.\nI'm tired of eating plain rice."

#. Key:	239D2FCF365F4E6BAB024B075A0D2EA2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Food00_T.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Food00_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",239D2FCF365F4E6BAB024B075A0D2EA2"
msgid "It's what we have.\nYou <b>should</> be thankful there's food at all, <i>y'know?</>"
msgstr "It's what we have.\nYou <b>should</> be thankful there's food at all, <i>y'know?</>"

#. Key:	A1DFB0EB6F6043219555FFB38A3FB1CB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Fridge00_T.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Fridge00_T.Text
msgctxt ",A1DFB0EB6F6043219555FFB38A3FB1CB"
msgid "At least there are still some eggs..."
msgstr "At least there are still some eggs..."

#. Key:	6231EECD69BF47D7A9AC8441C19FD3B2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_L.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_L.Text
msgctxt ",6231EECD69BF47D7A9AC8441C19FD3B2"
msgid "Maybe I could sit, and eat here."
msgstr "Maybe I could sit, and eat here."

#. Key:	48F261216E1841718210C1C0243B6519
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_T.0.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_T.0.Text
msgctxt ",48F261216E1841718210C1C0243B6519"
msgid "Eat..."
msgstr "Eat..."

#. Key:	D54177E2689740F385C464F567252557
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_T.1.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.IS3_T.1.Text
msgctxt ",D54177E2689740F385C464F567252557"
msgid "...alone."
msgstr "...alone."

#. Key:	E1F57B0E96CC4DA18B77B446A324097C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Item.Fail.BadTarget.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Dialogs/Chaps/04/Diags04.Diags04.Item.Fail.BadTarget.Text
msgctxt ",E1F57B0E96CC4DA18B77B446A324097C"
msgid "Does not combine properly."
