#. Key:	A96AC0BC3893437D83335EEB93DF782C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
msgctxt ",A96AC0BC3893437D83335EEB93DF782C"
msgid "\"She opened her gaze to the world,\nShe saw it as it was;\nAnd it hurted her."
msgstr "\"She opened her gaze to the world,\nShe saw it as it was;\nAnd it hurted her."

#. Key:	EB3F4229B81E4F3199A53F1918FDB379
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
msgctxt ",EB3F4229B81E4F3199A53F1918FDB379"
msgid "Bleeding she decided to keep going, she learned to become strong;\nAnd discovered that the pain was not eternal.\nThen relieved, she sighed strongly...\nand smiled.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 07/01/18"
msgstr "Bleeding she decided to keep going, she learned to become strong;\nAnd discovered that the pain was not eternal.\nThen relieved, she sighed strongly...\nand smiled.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 07/01/18"

#. Key:	EA9EA3508C78431786A15EC85CD9B887
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Title
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P00.Title
msgctxt ",EA9EA3508C78431786A15EC85CD9B887"
msgid "Poem 00"
msgstr "Poem 00"

#. Key:	76DDD0EC283C456BA171FAF486DE69A4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
msgctxt ",76DDD0EC283C456BA171FAF486DE69A4"
msgid "\"While our body stops\nOur mind starts racing,\nLeaving us restless and breathless.\nLet's silence senseless thoughts,\nThoughts that hurt,\nThoughts so empty."
msgstr "\"While our body stops\nOur mind starts racing,\nLeaving us restless and breathless.\nLet's silence senseless thoughts,\nThoughts that hurt,\nThoughts so empty."

#. Key:	95C19E04A79D4958B63DE640B7FB6114
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
msgctxt ",95C19E04A79D4958B63DE640B7FB6114"
msgid "And let's seize this opportunity\nTo meet again with ourselves.\nCultivating our good qualities,\nAdmiting our half-lights,\nIlluminating our darkest side,\nRescuing our lost humanity,\nReblooming the true worth and meaning of life.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 01/04/20"
msgstr "And let's seize this opportunity\nTo meet again with ourselves.\nCultivating our good qualities,\nAdmiting our half-lights,\nIlluminating our darkest side,\nRescuing our lost humanity,\nReblooming the true worth and meaning of life.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 01/04/20"

#. Key:	FA643B0FF83D470384204FD9D55154A9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Title
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P01.Title
msgctxt ",FA643B0FF83D470384204FD9D55154A9"
msgid "Poem 01"
msgstr "Poem 01"

#. Key:	AFDC080B7CCC41B2A8D579261EB18125
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
msgctxt ",AFDC080B7CCC41B2A8D579261EB18125"
msgid "\"And I stood thinking\nAnd i realized that among laughs and tears\nLife goes away\nThat giving so much to others\nI took away from myself\nThat my guide and support are my values\nAnd in that road I walk safe..."
msgstr "\"And I stood thinking\nAnd i realized that among laughs and tears\nLife goes away\nThat giving so much to others\nI took away from myself\nThat my guide and support are my values\nAnd in that road I walk safe..."

#. Key:	D3C0C83001C5476E8D88F600439E2736
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
msgctxt ",D3C0C83001C5476E8D88F600439E2736"
msgid "And I stood thinking\nThat in this present I am not the one from yesterday\nNor tomorrow\nAnd what I do with the today has influence in who I will become the next day\nBut can't change who I was the day before\n..."
msgstr "And I stood thinking\nThat in this present I am not the one from yesterday\nNor tomorrow\nAnd what I do with the today has influence in who I will become the next day\nBut can't change who I was the day before\n..."

#. Key:	59B475E488BF4BF9B41C66DC5CFAD4BB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(2).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(2).Descriptions
msgctxt ",59B475E488BF4BF9B41C66DC5CFAD4BB"
msgid "So I tell you...\nDon't suffer for what has happened\nYou can't change it\nDon't feel regret for what you don't know if it will happen\nThe things we plan for can change.\nEnjoy and live who you are today because that is the only thing in your hands\nThe only real thing is our present\nSo... every day come to life again\n..."
msgstr "So I tell you...\nDon't suffer for what has happened\nYou can't change it\nDon't feel regret for what you don't know if it will happen\nThe things we plan for can change.\nEnjoy and live who you are today because that is the only thing in your hands\nThe only real thing is our present\nSo... every day come to life again\n..."

#. Key:	1783E67FB924467AA71E5159E8B0C270
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(3).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Descriptions(3).Descriptions
msgctxt ",1783E67FB924467AA71E5159E8B0C270"
msgid "And I stood thinking...\nThat it was simpler to stop thinking\nThen I decided to live.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 02/07/2016"
msgstr "And I stood thinking...\nThat it was simpler to stop thinking\nThen I decided to live.\"\n\n- Paula Martinez 02/07/2016"

#. Key:	C12281348E85431B942146A859CDF9B0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Title
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P02.Title
msgctxt ",C12281348E85431B942146A859CDF9B0"
msgid "Poem 02"
msgstr "Poem 02"

#. Key:	C79582FCF7B7440CA5BA8E1F499E97C6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(0).Descriptions
msgctxt ",C79582FCF7B7440CA5BA8E1F499E97C6"
msgid "\"It's not true that loneliness is so alone\nThe masks don't let us see the friendly hands\nWe look for help where there is none\nBlinded to accept the one offered to us\nMaybe in the dissapointment of not getting it from who we expect\nAnd infatuated we cloister ourselves,\nIgnoring the most valuable and silent presences"
msgstr "\"It's not true that loneliness is so alone\nThe masks don't let us see the friendly hands\nWe look for help where there is none\nBlinded to accept the one offered to us\nMaybe in the dissapointment of not getting it from who we expect\nAnd infatuated we cloister ourselves,\nIgnoring the most valuable and silent presences"

#. Key:	DE7E3D399654407A952375A26BA8120E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(1).Descriptions
msgctxt ",DE7E3D399654407A952375A26BA8120E"
msgid "In the face of discouragement, sadness, and absolute silence\nDon't ever hesitate to shout for help\nWilling to accept whomever presents in your way."
msgstr "In the face of discouragement, sadness, and absolute silence\nDon't ever hesitate to shout for help\nWilling to accept whomever presents in your way."

#. Key:	C42FD18DEA1140ACB58198C1D214715E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(2).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(2).Descriptions
msgctxt ",C42FD18DEA1140ACB58198C1D214715E"
msgid "Life is many times hard, rough,\nBut the pain always passes,\nAlso existing many moments of big joy\nAnd so the days pass...\nThe deepest wounds, it is true, leave marks, but they heal, be born again.\nWe are never alone in this struggles\nWe only are so when we don't learn to ask for help."
msgstr "Life is many times hard, rough,\nBut the pain always passes,\nAlso existing many moments of big joy\nAnd so the days pass...\nThe deepest wounds, it is true, leave marks, but they heal, be born again.\nWe are never alone in this struggles\nWe only are so when we don't learn to ask for help."

#. Key:	3248A2BDB96A4235BBFD0FB7C663288E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(3).Descriptions
#: /Game/LifeDev/Game/Inventory/Items.Items.P03.Descriptions(3).Descriptions
msgctxt ",3248A2BDB96A4235BBFD0FB7C663288E"
msgid "And in each new foot print\nBuild a new walk,\nIt's always possible to walk again\nWithout loosing ourselves in resentment\nLearning to grow\nJust as we see the moon at dusk\nAnd after each night the light reborns again.\n\n- Paula Martìnez 05/02/2020"
msgstr "And in each new foot print\nBuild a new walk,\nIt's always possible to walk again\nWithout loosing ourselves in resentment\nLearning to grow\nJust as we see the moon at dusk\nAnd after each night the light reborns again.\n\n- Paula Martìnez 05/02/2020"

