#. Key:	13C084921B784945A16270F9949CCFB2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.Notes.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.Notes.Text
msgctxt ",13C084921B784945A16270F9949CCFB2"
msgid "<bold>Notes</>\n\n* The settings menu allows you to set your visual preferences, \nas well as checking the current control scheme, \nand pausing/exiting the game.\n\n* You can open it in game by pressing the \"Tab\" key.\n\n* Be sure to disable flashing lights if you need to."
msgstr "<bold>Notes</>\n\n* The settings menu allows you to set your visual preferences, \nas well as checking the current control scheme, \nand pausing/exiting the game.\n\n* You can open it in game by pressing the \"Tab\" key.\n\n* Be sure to disable flashing lights if you need to."

#. Key:	41A8B995C9104A2BA72BD4585D337D69
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.RichTextBlock.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.RichTextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",41A8B995C9104A2BA72BD4585D337D69"
msgid "<bold>Warning</>\n\n* Might contain flashing lights and distorted images.\n\n* The game touches <bold>sensitive topics.</>\nThis a trigger warning, and a recommendation for discretion.\n\n* The dialogs, characters' thoughts,  and situations are part of a flawed story.\nAnd can (mostly) be wrong or incorrect. \nThese are not representative of the author's ideas and beliefs, or the way things should be.\nAnd should not be taken as advice.\n\n* This game is is not made to diagnose, treat, or cure any affliction.\n\n* The story, all names, characters, and incidents portrayed in this production are fictitious.\nNo identification with actual persons (living or deceased), situations, places, buildings, \nand products is intended or should be inferred.\n\n* If you or someone else is at danger of harm, seek professional help."
msgstr "<bold>Warning</>\n\n* Might contain flashing lights and distorted images.\n\n* The game touches <bold>sensitive topics.</>\nThis a trigger warning, and a recommendation for discretion.\n\n* The dialogs, characters' thoughts,  and situations are part of a flawed story.\nAnd can (mostly) be wrong or incorrect. \nThese are not representative of the author's ideas and beliefs, or the way things should be.\nAnd should not be taken as advice.\n\n* This game is is not made to diagnose, treat, or cure any affliction.\n\n* The story, all names, characters, and incidents portrayed in this production are fictitious.\nNo identification with actual persons (living or deceased), situations, places, buildings, \nand products is intended or should be inferred.\n\n* If you or someone else is at danger of harm, seek professional help."

#. Key:	71AAE0B9240044C88F4EE5515AF49339
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.RichTextBlock_68.Text
#: /Game/LifeDev/Intro/UI/IntroUI_W.IntroUI_W_C:WidgetTree.RichTextBlock_68.Text
msgctxt ",71AAE0B9240044C88F4EE5515AF49339"
msgid "<bold>Welcome!</>\n\nThis is just a prototype, so it's super barebones and it's intended to test the basics.\nThe focus of the game is on story progression (narrative), though there's little of anything right now.\n\nPlease take note of your feedback, which will greatly help me in shaping this experience.\n\nThank you very much for your time and your help. \nEnjoy!"
msgstr "<bold>Welcome!</>\n\nThis is just a prototype, so it's super barebones and it's intended to test the basics.\nThe focus of the game is on story progression (narrative), though there's little of anything right now.\n\nPlease take note of your feedback, which will greatly help me in shaping this experience.\n\nThank you very much for your time and your help. \nEnjoy!"

